{"parse":{"title":"技能图鉴库/柯瓦雷的馈赠","pageid":5004,"revid":11215,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E6%9F%AF%E7%93%A6%E9%9B%B7%E7%9A%84%E9%A6%88%E8%B5%A0&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E6%9F%AF%E7%93%A6%E9%9B%B7%E7%9A%84%E9%A6%88%E8%B5%A0&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E6%9F%AF%E7%93%A6%E9%9B%B7%E7%9A%84%E9%A6%88%E8%B5%A0&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>柯瓦雷的馈赠</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E6.9F.AF.E7.93.A6.E9.9B.B7.E7.9A.84.E9.A6.88.E8.B5.A0\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"柯瓦雷的馈赠\"><b>柯瓦雷的馈赠</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" style=\"max-width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"5\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"技能 柯瓦雷的馈赠.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/b/b6/4b56akywje32gxeeux1ufno70zy0qhu.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E6%9F%AF%E7%93%A6%E9%9B%B7%E7%9A%84%E9%A6%88%E8%B5%A0.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/b/b6/4b56akywje32gxeeux1ufno70zy0qhu.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E6%9F%AF%E7%93%A6%E9%9B%B7%E7%9A%84%E9%A6%88%E8%B5%A0.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/b/b6/4b56akywje32gxeeux1ufno70zy0qhu.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />柯瓦雷的馈赠\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>/\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>/\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>对单位\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>1-5\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓8-↑8\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>0\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓0-↑0\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（治疗）治疗目标，治疗量为魔攻值的<font color=\"#58cb48\">40%</font>，并使目标分摊自身承受的<font color=\"#ed7950\">50%</font>伤害（单次分摊量不超过柯瓦雷70%最大生命值），持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合，不可驱散，无法免疫。若目标是敌人，则对其施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"晕眩\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">晕眩</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>回合；若目标是友军，则使其获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲攻击2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲攻击2</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲伤害2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲伤害2</font></span></span>]及[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"免伤2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">免伤2</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合。本技能每场战斗最多使用<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>次。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 1-5 0.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/9/95/at4dr45s2ma4cti9dv4gkekpa78egvl.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-5_0.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/9/95/at4dr45s2ma4cti9dv4gkekpa78egvl.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"90\" data-file-height=\"90\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E6%9F%AF%E7%93%A6%E9%9B%B7\" title=\"角色图鉴库/柯瓦雷\"><img alt=\"头像 柯瓦雷.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/8/8c/b0uj3v09e7bdw8fxdmzjeomq3pqg4y7.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">柯瓦雷</font></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-eve